{"color":"#f1d635","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/14181.jpg"},"description":"We are now in the early 18th century, the Kyouhou era, when the merchant culture was flourishing. In Yoshiwara, the red light district of Edo, there is a popular courtesan with good looks and character, called Usugumo. She in fact is a daughter of a Christianized prostitute and a shogun named Yoshimune, but the power struggle in these times doesn't allow her to be with her father. Her fate is about to change when she meets the blond haired thief, Kikunosuke. With Kikunosuke, a doctor named Aoto Touichirou, who uses the yet unfamiliar Western medicine, and her pet cat, Kotetsu, Usugumo forms a thief group, the Kikugumi. In the meanwhile, a member of a mysterious group appears, aiming for Usugumo... <br><br>\n(Source: AniDB)","duration":30,"endDate":{"day":23,"month":7,"year":1993},"episodes":1,"externalLinks":[{"language":"Japanese","site":"Official Site","type":"INFO","url":"https://www.madhouse.co.jp/works/1993-1992/works_ova_oedo.html"}],"genres":["Drama","Fantasy"],"hashtag":null,"isLicensed":true,"meanScore":48,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"rankings":[],"relations":[["SOURCE",34212,4212,"MANGA","MANGA"]],"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":1993,"source":"MANGA","startDate":{"day":23,"month":7,"year":1993},"stats":{"scoreDistribution":[{"amount":16,"score":10},{"amount":10,"score":20},{"amount":43,"score":30},{"amount":55,"score":40},{"amount":100,"score":50},{"amount":57,"score":60},{"amount":38,"score":70},{"amount":8,"score":80},{"amount":2,"score":90},{"amount":3,"score":100}],"statusDistribution":[{"amount":15,"status":"CURRENT"},{"amount":380,"status":"PLANNING"},{"amount":450,"status":"COMPLETED"},{"amount":23,"status":"DROPPED"},{"amount":10,"status":"PAUSED"}]},"status":"FINISHED","streamingEpisodes":[],"studios":[[11,"MADHOUSE",true,true],[6570,"Shueisha",false,false]],"synonyms":["Sleepless Oedo"],"title":{"english":null,"native":"お江戸はねむれない","romaji":"Oedo wa Nemurenai!"},"trailer":null,"trending":0,"type":"ANIME","updatedAt":1793624639},"14183":{"al":14183,"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/14183-6GZYny2CRuyM.jpg","coverImage":{"color":"#0d86e4","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b14183-eNQlGNa87Amm.png"},"description":"Kenji is a motorcyclist enthusiast who loves nothing more than to ride around on his motorcycle. He invites Tomomi on a tour of Hakone, but by doing so is introduced to a car driver named \"Wednesday's Cinderella\", whose Porsche is supposedly haunted by the \"devil\". Motorcyclists show up every week to try and compete against the driver, but none of them ever win.\nKenji sees this as a challenge and asks a bike shop owner to tune his bike for the purpose of competing against this driver, just for pure fun. The bike shop owner refuses due to past trauma that gets triggered upon the sight of his bike (and due to trauma that the Cinderella driver has), but eventually does so anyway, in the hopes that Kenji can cure the Cinderella driver's trauma by winning.","duration":50,"endDate":{"day":1,"month":8,"year":1987},"episodes":1,"externalLinks":[],"genres":["Drama","Sports"],"hashtag":null,"isLicensed":true,"meanScore":61,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"rankings":[],"relations":[["SOURCE",58955,28955,"MANGA","MANGA"]],"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":1987,"source":"MANGA","startDate":{"day":1,"month":8,"year":1987},"stats":{"scoreDistribution":[{"amount":9,"score":10},{"amount":10,"score":20},{"amount":12,"score":30},{"amount":15,"score":40},{"amount":31,"score":50},{"amount":54,"score":60},{"amount":38,"score":70},{"amount":37,"score":80},{"amount":7,"score":90},{"amount":18,"score":100}],"statusDistribution":[{"amount":23,"status":"CURRENT"},{"amount":331,"status":"PLANNING"},{"amount":301,"status":"COMPLETED"},{"amount":36,"status":"DROPPED"},{"amount":6,"status":"PAUSED"}]},"status":"FINISHED","streamingEpisodes":[